# AFFE — American Funding & Fidelity Explorer

**Purpose**: Classifies public funding streams as on-mission (constitutionally authorized) or off-mission (ultra vires or misapplied). Identifies recoverable constitutional capital.

**Firing Order**: After cff, before ciri.

**Key Features**:
- On-mission vs off-mission classification
- Feeds directly into CIRI for ROI calculation
- Supports 0-1 and 2σ–4σ divergence layers

**Transparency Note**: Part of the non-commercial ABE framework (CC BY-NC 4.0). No monetization allowed.

**Last Updated**: April 2026
